{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116749","id":3324052795,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7GIQU7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116749","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116749/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116749/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116749/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6114c6a2663d11fc7b272aab516a0e56f4704c57","number":116749,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add automatic smoothing for CSG nodes","user":{"login":"Jesusemora","id":32273722,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjczNzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32273722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora","html_url":"https://github.com/Jesusemora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1862\r\n\r\nPrepares for https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14319 in order to implement smoothing groups, I need this and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115926 merged first, so that would be it's own PR.\r\n\r\n# Added automatic smoothing to all CSG nodes through CSGShape3D\r\nIt works on individual meshes and also on children of `CSGCombiner3D`.\r\n\r\n- Tested with `CSGCombiner` `CSGBox`, `CSGCylinder`, `CSGTorus`, `CSGSphere`,`CSGPolygon3D` and `CSGMesh3D`.\r\n- Baking to mesh preserves normals.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"311\" height=\"126\" alt=\"inspector\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a4ff32e-5e46-474f-9ae0-1bb222b46a58\" />\r\n\r\n- `autosmooth` enables automatic smoothing. This overrides any smooth faces on the mesh, meaning it works on flat faced meshes like CSGBox\r\n<img width=\"372\" height=\"423\" alt=\"smooth_cube\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58c29cf0-8e4f-4efd-8cc7-67e7d0dae382\" />\r\n\r\n- `smoothing_angle`: when comparing two faces of a mesh, if the angle is higher than this, the vertices are smoothed, otherwise they remain sharp.\r\nSetting this to a value lower than 0.1 skips the smoothing, which could lead to a performance increase.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1074\" height=\"650\" alt=\"auto_0\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1c8e325-ca91-43c7-a954-7b9bf61dd8d3\" />\r\n<img width=\"1108\" height=\"666\" alt=\"auto_30\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64cc16fc-3630-49e7-a8b3-b80112c94175\" />\r\n<img width=\"1106\" height=\"688\" alt=\"auto_50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d69a07bf-4f8f-4008-8782-b771d3b8803a\" />\r\n<img width=\"1109\" height=\"680\" alt=\"auto_80\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abd73471-6c1f-4e26-bd98-99a4d730656e\" />\r\n<img width=\"857\" height=\"525\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-02-25 034110\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6547fb5f-4313-434e-87a9-64d1cefb5484\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"651\" height=\"579\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-02-27 095918\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a1de222-f862-4b89-9383-755943ea18b5\" />\r\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"618\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-02-27 100206\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2629df49-da1b-4b43-818d-3652d7b9bddb\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events